2 TITL Francisca Martínez De Angulo
2 _PRIM Y
2 NOTE Francisca Martínez De Angulo was the wife of a captain and conqueror, and also a truly mestiza, as her mother and grandmother belonged to the Muisca tribe. By now, Francisca moves more in the ways and customs  of the Spanish conqu
3 CONC erors. Her language is Spanish and her religion, Catholic. Of all the gold her ancestors used to cover their bodies with, now Francisca just carries her wedding ring, a necklace with a religious image, and a pair of earrings to we
3 CONC ar and show off in special occasions. The gold that is discovered around her, is usually melt before having it sent to Spain.
