1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Short biography of Raimunda Palacio Restrepo===
2 CONT
2 CONT Raimunda Palacio contracted marriage with Ignacio Londoño Bernal, and they were recorded in the census with their 1-year-old son, Fermin LONDOÑO PALACIO, and their 11-year-old slave, Josefa, in the 1824 census of Abejorral. Almost
2 CONC  all of their children were among the early settlers of Manizales.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Taken from:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://raicespaisas.wordpress.com/2015/10/04/la-parentela-de-los-palacio-y-los-origenes-de-manizales/
