2 CONT Good evening Tom (Tom Blumer),
2 CONT
2 CONT This is to let you know your photo of don Ramon's white house in Santa Bárbara has been set as his profile photo in the Geni Family Tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT - February 18th, 2018
2 CONT
2 CONT Hi Camilo - thanks for that info.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Also I did look for Ramon's house near Santa Barbara church, but did not find it.
2 CONT
2 CONT I talked to several people that told me which street (in the old numbering) was Calle 4 (which is now Calle 6A)
2 CONT
2 CONT I walked west on 4th (6A) but did not see any house that looked like it matched the photo of Ramon's house.
2 CONT
2 CONT I also did the same on Calle 5 (now 6B), again did not see the house.
2 CONT
2 CONT Perhaps it is the house on the corner of Cl 6A and Cr 7 (seen in photos 1 and 2, and in the distance in 3) -- someone there told me that was a very old house.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also this area is 3 blocks from Casa Nariño (as in the description)
2 CONT
2 CONT Tom
2 CONT
2 CONT "Camilo - thank you very much. I read through all of the notes, very interesting. And interesting that Poli's mother and Enrique Peñalosa Camargo were 3rd cousins.
2 CONT
2 CONT "I did see the photo of Ramón González Gaitán as well, I loved seeing that. Where did you find that photo ?"
2 CONT
