3 NOTE Captain Domingo Antonio de Arango y Valdés, my 8th great grandfather, had to endure a long and hazardous trip, battle stormy weather, care for his crew and passengers aboard, not knowing if he would arrive safely to port in the Ne
4 CONC w World, and if upon arrival, would be received by fierce indigenous warriors. Somewhere along all this, he was able to settle down and reproduce. I descend from one of the branches he left behind, the Paisa branch, that colonized
4 CONC  Antioquia, the Coffee Region, and Nortern part of Tolima in Colombia.
